A,6,-1.5,0,-1.5
*DASHDOT2,Dash dot, half size
A,3,-0.75,0,-0.75
*DASHDOTX2,Dash dot, double size
A,12,-3,0,-3
*DIVIDE,Divide __ . . __ . . __ . .
A,6,-1.5,0,-1.5,0,-1.5
*DIVIDE2,Divide, half size
A,3,-0.75,0,-0.75,0,-0.75
*DIVIDEX2,Divide, double size
A,12,-3,0,-3,0,-3
*BORDER,Border __ __ . __ __ . __ __ .
